Optional baseline submodules
----------------------------
``external/baselines/`` records two third-party projects as pinned Git
submodule commits. No third-party source is redistributed here — a clone
without ``--recursive`` contains neither. Fetching them retrieves code under
its own licence, not this project's:

- CDiffMR (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/ayanglab/CDiffMR
- FDB (MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 ICON Lab) — https://github.com/icon-lab/FDB

Datasets and figures
--------------------
No MRI data ships with this repository, and no figure derived from MRI data
is published from it. M4Raw is CC-BY-4.0 and may be redistributed with
attribution; fastMRI is governed by its own data-use agreement, and neither
its data nor images derived from it are redistributed here. The rule and how
to apply it are in CONTRIBUTING.md, "Figure and data provenance".
